{"id": "3059fcbb-dbc3-4688-9a1c-e3f58452b3fe", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T01:32:05.095813", "source": "user", "parent_id": "d0d2f920-1dde-4da6-a938-72633af303ca", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{"researcher_request": "कृपया पहले इनपुट और रिपॉजिटरी वातावरण की जांच करें। इसके बाद यह बताएं कि मल्टी-जीपीयू (multi-GPU) सेटअप पर ZB-2p ऑटोमैटिक शेड्यूलिंग एल्गोरिदम के व्यवहारिक बबल रेट (bubble rate) को प्रोफाइल करने और जांचने के लिए आपका प्रस्तावित दृष्टिकोण (proposed approach) क्या होगा। साथ ही अपनी मुख्य धारणाएं (assumptions) और अनिश्चितताएं (uncertainties) स्पष्ट करें। अभी अंतिम विस्तृत समाधान न दें।", "required_handoff_stage": "plan", "approach_approved": false, "public_task": {"question": "Does the automatic scheduling algorithm’s output (ZB-2p) truly achieve a near-zero bubble rate in practice when profiled on multiple GPUs? (Note: The ZB-2p schedule should be activated by setting the appropriate zero bubble configuration flag, for example --zero-bubble-max-pending-backward set to twice the number of pipeline stages.)", "context": "Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.", "environment": {"runtime": "bubblewrap", "network": "disabled", "repository": "/workspace", "python": "python3", "software_environment": "system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled", "datasets": [], "gpu_enabled": false, "cpu_affinity_count": 24, "note": "Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment."}, "researcher_topics": [], "question_budget": 6, "actor_step_budget": 60, "continue_after_initial_plan": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 1}
